{
  "source": "simple-icons 16.38.1 (CC0-1.0, and Git's CC BY 3.0), https://github.com/simple-icons/simple-icons; Context7, Playwright, Firecrawl, Exa and Slack from the brands' own files (each entry's `origin` and `licence`; README.md)",
  "read": "2026-11-22",
  "rule": "A connector's tile shows the mark of the service it connects to, found from what it is or what it runs: the host of its address or the package or image it starts, when that names a listed service; else its id in boopis's collection or its own name, read as one key (case, a scope, separators and the words mcp and server aside: `connectorKey` in components/item-mark.ts; the owner, 27 November 2026: an installed connector matches the collection's mark), or (for a store item) the host of its home page. A skill, plugin or mod shows its publisher's mark when its source proves the publisher (anything but a namespace proof of none) and the publisher's name is listed here exactly. Hosts are exact (a leading www. is ignored); a code host such as github.com is never listed, since anyone can publish there. Anything not listed gets letters.",
